BT 0 0 0 rg /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 58 636.9999999999999 Tm (3. Create an Azure Resource Manager service connection with **workload) Tj ET
BT 0 0 0 rg /F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 52 625.9999999999999 Tm (identity federation**, not a client secret. Use the exact tenant and) Tj ET
BT 0 0 0 rg /F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 52 613.8999999999999 Tm (subscription. Configure and validate the generated federation credential;) Tj ET
BT 0 0 0 rg /F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 52 601.7999999999998 Tm (authorize only this pipeline. Add a server-side Branch control check to) Tj ET
BT 0 0 0 rg /F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 52 589.6999999999998 Tm (the service connection that allows only protected refs/heads/main and) Tj ET
BT 0 0 0 rg /F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 52 577.5999999999998 Tm (fails closed for unknown protection status. Do not rely on YAML stage) Tj ET
BT 0 0 0 rg /F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 52 565.4999999999998 Tm (conditions alone to protect the connection from pull-request code.) Tj ET
BT 0 0 0 rg /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 58 553.3999999999997 Tm (4. Assign the service identity only the resource-group rights needed to create) Tj ET
BT 0 0 0 rg /F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 52 542.3999999999997 Tm (SQL, monitoring, and private endpoint resources, plus the narrowly scoped) Tj ET
BT 0 0 0 rg /F1 9.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 52 530.2999999999997 Tm (subnet and Private DNS permissions required for endpoint creation. Grant) Tj ET
